  unitName: Floret Petal Rosetta
  unitId: 30543
  unitNumber: 821
  description: A young girl who loved flowers, and was in turn loved by the gods.
    At first, she was an ordinary girl who lived in a village near Mistral. It is
    said that she gained her powers when she headed towards the Tower of Trials where
    the gods lived, and spoke directly to them. Although there are no reliable sources
    that confirm this, some believe that she was the queen of a small ruined country
    who sought power in order to save her sick mother. There are many theories surrounding
    the identity of the gods she served.
  summonDesc: I'm thankful for this wonderful<br>encounter. Let's pour love into
    this bud,<br>and bloom it together.
  fusionDesc: Thank you.<br>A blossom well taken care of<br>blooms into a beautiful
    flower.
